>Login</span></button></a><span aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 left-full ml-0 -translate-x-15 px-2.5 py-2 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-normal text-xs transition-transform duration-300 h-8 flex items-center justify-center z-0 group-hover:translate-x-0\"><svg class=\"w-3 h-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17\"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"space-y-6 py-12 sm:py-20 lg:py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col items-center gap-5 px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><h1 class=\"text-balance font-urban text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[66px] transition-all duration-1500 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-4\">Vom Website-Dschungel zum<!-- --> <span class=\"text-gradient_indigo-purple font-extrabold\">smarten Chatbot</span></h1><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-balance leading-normal text-muted-foreground sm:text-xl sm:leading-8 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out delay-300 opacity-0 translate-y-4\">CraCha scannt selbst die tiefsten und unübersichtlichsten Websites mit nur einem Klick – und erschafft daraus einen intelligenten Chatbot, der ausschließlich mit Ihren Daten antwortet. Präzise Antworten statt endloser Klicks.</p><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><a href=\"/dashboard\"><button class=\"group relative inline-flex h-11 animate-rainbow cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full border-0 bg-[length:200%] px-8 py-2 font-medium text-primary-foreground [background-clip:padding-box,border-box,border-box] [background-origin:border-box] [border:calc(0.08*1rem)_solid_transparent] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 before:absolute before:bottom-[-20%] before:left-1/2 before:z-0 before:h-1/5 before:w-3/5 before:-translate-x-1/2 before:bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,hsl(var(--color-1)),hsl(var(--color-5)),hsl(var(--color-3)),hsl(var(--color-4)),hsl(var(--color-2)))] before:bg-[length:200%] before:[filter:blur(calc(0.8*1rem))] bg-[linear-gradient(#121213,#121213),linear-gradient(#121213_50%,rgba(18,18,19,0.6)_80%,rgba(18,18,19,0)),linear-gradient(90deg,hsl(var(--color-1)),hsl(var(--color-5)),hsl(var(--color-3)),hsl(var(--color-4)),hsl(var(--color-2)))] dark:bg-[linear-gradient(#fff,#fff),linear-gradient(#fff_50%,rgba(255,255,255,0.6)_80%,rgba(0,0,0,0)),linear-gradient(90deg,hsl(var(--color-1)),hsl(var(--color-5)),hsl(var(--color-3)),hsl(var(--color-4)),hsl(var(--color-2)))] gap-2 transition-all duration-1500 ease-out delay-1000 opacity-0 translate-y-4\"><span>jetzt Starten</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></a></div></div></section><div class=\"transition-all duration-2000 ease-in-out opacity-0 translate-y-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl mb-3 [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,black_50%,transparent_100%)]\"><div class=\"[perspective:1200px] -mr-16 pl-16 lg:-mr-56 lg:pl-56\"><div class=\"[transform:rotateX(20deg);]\"><div class=\"lg:h-[44rem] relative skew-x-[.36rad] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_30%,transparent_100%)]\"><img alt=\"Tailark hero section\" width=\"2880\" height=\"2074\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"z-[2] relative dark:hidden transition-opacity\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/hero/Screenshot 2025-08-23 182239.png\"/><img alt=\"Tailark hero section\" width=\"2880\" height=\"2074\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"z-[2] relative hidden dark:block transition-opacity\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/hero/Screenshot 2025-08-23 191201.png\"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"transition-all duration-2000 ease-in-out opacity-0 translate-y-16\"><section class=\"pb-0 md:py-0 text-muted-foreground overflow-hidden transition-opacity duration-2000 ease-out opacity-0\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl\"><h2 class=\"text-center text-sm font-semibold uppercase\">Powered by</h2><div class=\"relative pt-12 pb-0 -ml-2 sm:-ml-4\"><div class=\"h-12 sm:h-14\"></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"transition-all duration-2000 ease-in-out opacity-0 translate-y-16\"><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-12 max-w-3xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl leading-tight md:text-5xl text-foreground\">So einfach geht <span class=\"text-gradient_indigo-purple\">CraCha</span></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">CraCha automatisiert das Crawling Ihrer Webinhalte, strukturiert das Wissen und liefert präzise KI-basierte Antworten. Verwalten Sie alles zentral und halten Sie Ihre Daten mühelos aktuell.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-8\"><li class=\"min-h-[14rem] list-none\"><div class=\"relative h-full rounded-[1.25rem] border-[0.75px] border-border p-2 md:rounded-[1.5rem] md:p-3\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px hidden rounded-[inherit] border transition-opacity opacity-100\"></div><div style=\"--blur:0px;--spread:40;--start:0;--active:0;--glowingeffect-border-width:3px;--repeating-conic-gradient-times:5;--gradient:radial-gradient(circle, #dd7bbb 10%, #dd7bbb00 20%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 40% 40%, #d79f1e 5%, #d79f1e00 15%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 60% 60%, #5a922c 10%, #5a922c00 20%), \n                radial-gradient(circle at 40% 60%, #4c7894 10%, #4c789400 20%),\n            